# Repository boundaries

## Observed systems

### Entity: Contracts

Solidity contracts, ENS adapters/interfaces, tests, and deployment records. Records are not live-health evidence.

```yaml
entity: Contracts
type: component
properties:
  adr:
    default: docs/adrs/0005-trigger-and-settlement.md
  paths:
    default: contracts/
states: [observed]
```

### Entity: Shared

Shared feed and Trigger contracts, computation, exported ABIs, and deployment addresses. Review together with Solidity when their interface changes.

```yaml
entity: Shared
type: component
properties:
  adr:
    default: docs/adrs/0005-trigger-and-settlement.md
  paths:
    default: packages/shared/
states: [observed]
```

### Entity: Pipeline

Python (uv) FastAPI risk API scaffold for the heat, HAB and storm modules, its Docker/Caddy deployment files and pytest suite, plus pinned buoy/toxin/geographic inputs, and the separate PostgreSQL/PostGIS service spec under db/ (#110). Domain routes remain 501 stubs; /health, API docs and OpenAPI are available. Real index values are planned under #82. The TypeScript feed server and signer were removed; signing moves to the keeper (#64).

```yaml
entity: Pipeline
type: component
properties:
  adr:
    default: docs/adrs/0003-risk-api-and-keeper.md
  paths:
    default: pipeline/ db/
states: [observed]
```

### Entity: Application

Current Next.js UI/routes, keeper, wallet/identity flows, event handling, and LINE integration, plus the frontend/ Astro and Storybook foundation. Production route and service migration remains under #54.

```yaml
entity: Application
type: component
properties:
  adr:
    default: docs/adrs/0002-astro-and-app-core.md
  paths:
    default: web/ frontend/
states: [observed]
```

### Entity: Tooling

Bun workspace configuration, dependency lock, repository scripts, CI, and agent settings.

```yaml
entity: Tooling
type: component
properties:
  adr:
    default: docs/adrs/0001-observed-code-and-design-intent.md
  paths:
    default: scripts/ .github/ .claude/ package.json bun.lock tsconfig.base.json skills-lock.json .gitignore .gitmodules
states: [observed]
```

### Entity: Documentation

Product description, architecture, integration contracts, and repository instructions.

```yaml
entity: Documentation
type: component
properties:
  adr:
    default: docs/adrs/README.md
  paths:
    default: README.md CLAUDE.md docs/
states: [observed]
```

### Entity: Postgres

PostgreSQL/PostGIS database service, separate from the pipeline and app (db/README.md, issues
#103-#110). `geo`/`risk` are dbmate-migrated (Jay-owned); `app` is Drizzle-migrated (application-owned,
issue #62). Only a `geo` bootstrap (`db/migrations/`) and its interim runner (`db/scripts/`) exist here
so far — the full service scaffold (compose, roles, pgTAP) is #103, not yet built.

```yaml
entity: Postgres
type: component
properties:
  adr:
    default: docs/adrs/0004-postgres-schema-ownership.md
  paths:
    default: db/
states: [observed]
```

## Planned systems

### Entity: AstroApplication

Completed Astro application and app-core migration, owned by #54/#63. The frontend/ foundation exists; production routes and server-service migration are still pending.

```yaml
entity: AstroApplication
type: planned
properties:
  adr:
    default: docs/adrs/0002-astro-and-app-core.md
  status:
    default: planned
states: [planned]
```

### Entity: FastApiRisk

Python/FastAPI risk API with real index values and exported producer schemas, owned by #82/#79. The route scaffold is observed under Pipeline; verify live data through #36/#77.

```yaml
entity: FastApiRisk
type: planned
properties:
  adr:
    default: docs/adrs/0003-risk-api-and-keeper.md
  status:
    default: planned
states: [planned]
```

## Relationships

### Relationship: Contracts → Shared

```yaml
relationship: Contracts -> Shared
verb: exports
description: Contract ABI and Trigger agreement; coordinated review required.
```

### Relationship: Application → Shared

```yaml
relationship: Application -> Shared
verb: depends_on
description: Existing consumer validation, ABI calls, and signing types.
```

### Relationship: AstroApplication → FastApiRisk

```yaml
relationship: AstroApplication -> FastApiRisk
verb: depends_on
description: Planned typed handoff under #55/#79; not observed runtime traffic.
```

### Relationship: AstroApplication → Postgres

```yaml
relationship: AstroApplication -> Postgres
verb: depends_on
description: A Railway PostgreSQL/PostGIS instance now exists (db/postgres-plots task) with an app schema Drizzle-migrated from web/; AstroApplication (frontend/) itself has not been wired to it.
```
